{"body":"\n        <div id=\"profile-pane\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl p-6 lg:p-10\">\n            <div class=\"mb-8 flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"avatar avatar-placeholder shrink-0\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-content\">\n                        <span class=\"text-lg font-bold\">7</span>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"min-w-0\">\n                    <h1 class=\"truncate text-2xl font-bold\">77fdcea083954eb0923eee18eccd667e</h1>\n                    <p class=\"truncate font-mono text-xs opacity-60\">77fdcea083954eb0923eee18eccd667e@example.test &middot; joined <time datetime=\"2026-11-08T14:43:58.273239+00:00\" data-local-time=\"date\">Nov 08, 2026 UTC</time></p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-warning\">Email unverified. Email-based invitations, restricted channel access, and operator access are unavailable until you confirm this address.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <section class=\"mb-6 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-6\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Account details</h2>\n                <p class=\"mb-4 text-xs opacity-60\">Your name and picture are what your team and your threads show you as; your address is what channels recognise you by.</p>\n                \n                \n                <form class=\"space-y-4\" hx-put=\"/ui/profile\" hx-target=\"#profile-pane\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\"\n                    hx-disabled-elt=\"find button[type='submit']\">\n                    \n                    <div id=\"profile-avatar\" class=\"form-control w-full\">\n                        <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">Your Picture</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <div class=\"avatar avatar-placeholder shrink-0\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-content\">\n                        <span class=\"text-lg font-bold\">7</span>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"avatar_url\" value=\"\">\n                            <input type=\"file\" name=\"avatar_file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp\"\n                                class=\"file-input file-input-sm w-full max-w-xs\"\n                                hx-post=\"/ui/uploads/avatar\" hx-encoding=\"multipart/form-data\"\n                                hx-target=\"#profile-avatar\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\"\n                                hx-params=\"avatar_file,avatar_url,avatar_field_id,avatar_name\" hx-vals=\"{&quot;avatar_field_id&quot;:&quot;profile-avatar&quot;,&quot;avatar_name&quot;:&quot;77fdcea083954eb0923eee18eccd667e&quot;}\"\n                                hx-disabled-elt=\"this\" hx-indicator=\"#profile-avatar-spinner\">\n                            <span id=\"profile-avatar-spinner\" class=\"htmx-indicator loading loading-spinner loading-sm\"></span>\n                            \n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"text-[11px] opacity-60\">PNG, JPEG, GIF or WebP, up to 5 MB. Saved when you save this form.</span></div>\n                    </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\">\n                        <label class=\"form-control w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">Username</span></div>\n                            <input type=\"text\" name=\"username\" required value=\"77fdcea083954eb0923eee18eccd667e\" placeholder=\"dana\"\n                                class=\"input w-full\">\n                        </label>\n                        <label class=\"form-control w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">Email Address</span></div>\n                            <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required value=\"77fdcea083954eb0923eee18eccd667e@example.test\" placeholder=\"dana@example.com\"\n                                class=\"input w-full font-mono\">\n                        </label>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] opacity-60\">A new address is mailed a code before it becomes yours, so it is not your account's until you confirm it. Changing it changes which channels treat you as a participant, and where mail addressed to you arrives. Installing the new address signs out every browser. Sign in again afterward.</p>\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-base-300 pt-4\">\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n                            <span class=\"loading loading-spinner loading-sm hidden [.htmx-request_&]:inline-block\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"[.htmx-request_&]:hidden\">Save Details</span>\n                            <span class=\"hidden [.htmx-request_&]:inline\">Saving...</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n        \n            </section>\n        \n            \n            <section class=\"mb-6 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-6\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Login methods</h2>\n                <p class=\"mb-4 text-xs opacity-60\">Connected methods sign in to this same account. Provider emails must match your account email.</p>\n                <div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Google</span><span class=\"text-xs opacity-50\">Unavailable</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Apple</span><span class=\"text-xs opacity-50\">Unavailable</span></div></div>\n            </section>\n        \n            <section class=\"mb-6 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Notifications</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-4 text-sm opacity-70\">In-app alerts always remain available. Choose what is also emailed.</p>\n            \n            <form hx-put=\"/ui/profile/notifications\" hx-target=\"#profile-pane\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\">\n                <label class=\"label cursor-pointer justify-start gap-3\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"decision_email_enabled\" value=\"true\" class=\"toggle toggle-primary\" checked>\n            <span>Email me when a workflow decision needs my review</span>\n        </label>\n                <label class=\"label cursor-pointer justify-start gap-3\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"delivery_failure_email_enabled\" value=\"true\" class=\"toggle toggle-primary\" checked>\n            <span>Permanent delivery failures assigned to me</span>\n        </label>\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm mt-3\">Save notifications</button>\n            </form>\n        </section>\n            \n            <section class=\"rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-6\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Password</h2>\n                <p class=\"mb-4 text-xs opacity-60\">Changing your password signs out every browser. Sign in again afterward.</p>\n                <div class=\"p-4 mb-4 rounded-xl bg-error/10 border border-error/40 text-base-content text-sm flex items-center gap-2 font-medium\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-base-content flex-shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 19 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n            <span>That is not your current password.</span>\n        </div>\n                \n                <form class=\"space-y-4\" hx-put=\"/ui/profile/password\" hx-target=\"#profile-pane\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\"\n                    hx-disabled-elt=\"find button[type='submit']\">\n                    <label class=\"form-control w-full\">\n                        <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">Current Password</span></div>\n                        <input type=\"password\" name=\"current_password\" required autocomplete=\"current-password\"\n                            class=\"input w-full\">\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\">\n                        <label class=\"form-control w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">New Password</span></div>\n                            <input type=\"password\" name=\"new_password\" required autocomplete=\"new-password\"\n                                minlength=\"8\" class=\"input w-full\">\n                        </label>\n                        <label class=\"form-control w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">Confirm New Password</span></div>\n                            <input type=\"password\" name=\"confirm_password\" required autocomplete=\"new-password\"\n                                minlength=\"8\" class=\"input w-full\">\n                        </label>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-base-300 pt-4\">\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n                            <span class=\"loading loading-spinner loading-sm hidden [.htmx-request_&]:inline-block\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"[.htmx-request_&]:hidden\">Change Password</span>\n                            <span class=\"hidden [.htmx-request_&]:inline\">Changing...</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n        \n            </section>\n        \n        </div>\n        ","headers":[["content-type","text/html; charset=utf-8"]],"status":200}